OL,3,ASuppliers pile pressure on government
OL,4,Aover energy bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government should take immediate
OL,7,Faction to help those struggling with
OL,8,Fenergy bills this winter, the
OL,9,Fsuppliers' trade body has said.
OL,11,FEnergy UK said domestic gas prices,
OL,12,Fwhich rose on Thursday, and forecasts
OL,13,Fof steep rises in January meant
OL,14,Finaction would lead to a longer-term,
OL,15,Fmore costly and deeper crisis.
OL,17,FFigures revealed by the BBC earlier
OL,18,Fthis week showed forecasters predicting
OL,19,Fa 16% rise in domestic energy prices in
OL,20,Fthe new year for 20 million households
OL,21,Fon variable tariffs affected by
OL,22,Fregulator Ofgem's price cap.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
