OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussia strikes second major bridge in
OL,4,AKyiv, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strike comes after another key
OL,7,Fbridge in the city, Southern
OL,8,F(Pivdennyi) Bridge, was targeted
OL,9,Fmultiple times by Russian drones on
OL,10,FThursday and Friday, with Klitschko
OL,11,Fearlier warning that such attacks were
OL,12,F"tearing Kyiv apart".
OL,14,FThe Northern and Southern bridges link
OL,15,Fthe eastern and western parts of the
OL,16,Fcapital and had not been hit before
OL,17,FThursday, signalling a new stage in
OL,18,FMoscow's strategy.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
