OL,3,AG7 to release millions of barrels of
OL,4,Aoil and diesel after Trump threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe G7 has announced 100 million
OL,7,Fbarrels of oil and diesel will be
OL,8,Freleased to ease supply concerns that
OL,9,Fhave caused prices to skyrocket.
OL,11,FIt includes a "substantial release" of
OL,12,Fdiesel within 20 days, with discussions
OL,13,Faround "additional diesel releases as
OL,14,Fnecessary", G7 leaders said in a
OL,15,Fstatement.
OL,17,FThe group of advanced economies,
OL,18,Fincluding the US, said the move would
OL,19,Fbegin immediately and would last for
OL,20,Ffour months.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
